OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 81, sentenced over death
OL,4,Aof motorcyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 81-year-old driver has been given a
OL,7,Fsuspended prison sentence for causing
OL,8,Fthe death of a motorcyclist in a crash
OL,9,Fnear Boroughbridge.
OL,11,FWilliam Beckett pulled into the path of
OL,12,Fa motorbike ridden by 64-year-old Nick
OL,13,FGilroy at Aldborough on 20 May 2023,
OL,14,FYork Crown Court heard. The victim died
OL,15,Fof his injuries two months later.
OL,17,FBeckett, of Vernham Dean in Hampshire,
OL,18,Fwas jailed for 12 months, suspended for
OL,19,F18 months, after being found guilty of
OL,20,Fcausing death by careless driving.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
