OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 81, sentenced over death
OL,4,Aof motorcyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing him on Friday, Judge Sean
OL,7,FMorris said he had shown "not one line
OL,8,Fof remorse", adding: "I'd dearly love
OL,9,Fto lock you up. Now go away and hang
OL,10,Fyour head in shame."
